{"ref": "Zohar, Terumah 83:808", "heRef": "ספר הזהר, תרומה פ״ג:תת״ח", "sectionRef": "Zohar, Terumah 83", "indexTitle": "Zohar", "heIndexTitle": "ספר הזהר", "categories": ["Kabbalah", "Zohar"], "next": "Zohar, Terumah 84", "sectionNames": ["Chapter", "Paragraph"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013", "license": "unknown", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990035741170205171/NLI", "hasText": true}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "The Zohar; London, Soncino Press, 1933", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH997012945475805171/NLI", "text": "The verse has already been interpreted in its symbolic significance. It is written: <i>A psalm of David. The Lord is my shepherd, I shall not want</i> (Ps. 23, 1). The difference between “a psalm of David” and “of David a psalm” has already been explained. In this psalm the Shekinah came first and rested upon the Psalmist, for, as has already been remarked, “a psalm of David” indicates that the first impulse proceeded from the Shekinah. But in this psalm David prays for nourishment, so that we should have thought the initiative would have come from him."}], "available_versions": [{"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "The Zohar; London, Soncino Press, 1933", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH997012945475805171/NLI"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013", "license": "unknown", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990035741170205171/NLI"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Sulam Edition, Jerusalem 1945", "license": "unknown", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001329911/NLI"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Hebrew Translation", "license": "unknown", "versionSource": "http://www.toratemetfreeware.com/online/d_root__106_kabala.html"}]}